{title: All People That on Earth Do Dwell}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{meta: tune OLD 100TH}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C]All [**]people [Am]that on [F]earth [G]do [C]dwell
[C]Sing [**]to the [Am]Lord with [F]cheer[C]ful [G]voice
[Am]Him [G]serve with [Dm]mirth, his [F]praise [G]forth [C]tell
[G]Come [Am]ye be[Dm]fore him [C]and [G]re[C]joice.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C]Know [**]that the [Am]Lord is [F]God [G]in[C]deed
[C]With[**]out our [Am]aid he [F]did [C]us [G]make
[Am]We [G]are his [Dm]folk, he [F]doth [G]us [C]feed
[G]And [Am]for his [Dm]sheep he [C]doth [G]us [C]take.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C]O [**]enter [Am]then his [F]gates [G]with [C]praise
[C]Ap[**]proach with [Am]joy his [F]courts [C]un[G]to
[Am]Praise, [G]laud, and [Dm]bless his [F]name [G]al[C]ways
[G]For [Am]it is [Dm]seemly [C]so [G]to [C]do.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
[C]For [**]why? the [Am]Lord our [F]God [G]is [C]good
[C]His [**]mercy [Am]is for[F]e[C]ver [G]sure
[Am]His [G]truth at [Dm]all times [F]firm[G]ly [C]stood
[G]And [Am]shall from [Dm]age to [C]age [G]en[C]dure.
{end_of_verse}
